        {
          "doc_text": " Instead of using this function, code should attempt to support unwinding.",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            3869,
            3946
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " Implementing [`Drop`] allows you to restore invariants uniformly in both",
