          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": "",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            4053,
            4056
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " If an unwind can lead to logical issues but not soundness issues, you",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            4057,
            4130
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " should allow the unwind. Opting out of [`UnwindSafe`] indicates to your",
          "path": "doc",
